<title>USA: Kansas City Southern buys 800,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Kansas City Southern buys 800,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kansas City Southern Industries Inc said Thursday during its first quarter the company repurchased more than 800,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>With these transactions, the company has repurchased more than nine million common shares since January 1995, effectively completing the 1995 repurchase program for eight million shares and part of the 1996 program, for three million shares.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
